<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Persian (Iran), a draft not yet read by a fluent reviewer (#495). The notes on each string are in values/strings.xml.
    "Vehicle" is خودرو, the general word, for whatever the agency runs; "run" is سرویس (a timetabled departure,
    as in سرویس ساعت ۶:۴۳); "trip" is سفر; "report" is گزارش; "dispatcher" is مرکز کنترل; "block" is بلوک;
    "agency" is شرکت; "route" is مسیر; "stop" is ایستگاه; "schedule" is برنامه زمانی; "sign in" is ورود and
    "sign out" خروج از حساب; "diagnostics" is اطلاعات عیب‌یابی. The address is the polite شما. A noun after a
    number stays singular, as Persian has it. Placeholders get no direction marks: the app wraps names and numbers.
-->
